 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you can spend 3 cursed energy as an action to create a localized storm centered on you in a 10 ft radius for 1 minute. You can spend additional cursed energy up to your proficiency bonus to increase the radius by 5 ft per cursed energy. <br />\n This area is difficult terrain and creatures that start their turn within range must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, they are knocked prone. Ranged attacks targeting a creature within this storm are made at disadvantage. When you deal lightning or thunder damage to a creature within this storm, you add your Cursed Energy modifier to the damage roll.</p>",
